  "abstract": "Serve Alibaba Qwen3.x open models (Qwen3.8-27B, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next, Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B, Qwen3.6, Qwen3.5, Qwen3-Coder-Next and older Qwen3) with the right parsers, thinking toggles, quants and context limits. Covers vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, llama.cpp, Ollama, MLX and TensorFold flags, NVFP4 on DGX Spark, RTX, Apple Silicon and datacenter GPUs, licenses and known bugs. References are split into models, parsers and templates, platforms and quants, and known issues.",
